        {
          "text": "FEI Mi 費密 (T. 此度, H. 燕峰, 卷隱), Aug. 25, 1625–1701, July–Aug., scholar, philosopher, and poet, was a native of Hsin-fan, Szechwan. His family was one of scholarly traditions, his father Fei Ching-yü 費經虞 (T. 仲著, H. 鮮民, 1599–1671), and both grandfathers, having been scholars and officials.",
